# electron/preload.js is GENERATED by scripts/build-preload.cjs from preload.ts.
#
# It must stay byte-identical to what esbuild emits, because
# tests/preload-terbangun.test.js re-runs the build and compares — that check is
# the only thing keeping the committed artefact honest. Letting prettier rewrite
# it puts the two permanently out of step: every rebuild would look "stale" even
# when the source had not changed at all.
#
# The SOURCE (electron/preload.ts) is still formatted normally.
electron/preload.js

# Vendored third-party bundles: not ours to reformat, and reformatting them
# would produce enormous diffs on every touch.
public/vendor/

# Build output.
dist-app/
